        "**Task4**:\n",
        "\n",
        "Run plot trace and rhat on your inference data object for the non-hierarchical soccer model. How does this compare to the hierarchical model?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "_cYMioF1Kv9G"
      }
